<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：什麼是旋轉Symmetry？ <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>旋轉Symmetry：</b>一個圖形繞著中心點旋轉<b>少於 360 度</b>後，同原來<b>完全重疊</b><br/>
      ② <b>旋轉Symmetry次數（重數）：</b>轉一圈（360度）會重疊幾多次<br/>
        例：Square旋轉 90度、180度、270度都會重疊 → 4重旋轉Symmetry<br/>
      ③ <b>軸Symmetry vs 旋轉Symmetry：</b>兩者係唔同概念！一個圖形可以有其中一種、兩種都有、或兩種都冇<br/>
      ④ <b>旋轉Symmetry的中心點：</b>圖形正中心。旋轉時中心點保持不動
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 480 150" width="480">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="240" y="18">Square旋轉Symmetry：每轉90度重疊一次（4重）</text>
<!-- Position 1: 0 degrees -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="80" x="30" y="35"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="130">0度（原圖）</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="16" font-weight="900" x="120" y="75">→</text>
<!-- Position 2: 90 degrees -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="80" x="145" y="35"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1.5" x1="185" x2="185" y1="35" y2="115"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="185" y="130">90度</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="16" font-weight="900" x="235" y="75">→</text>
<!-- Position 3: 180 degrees -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="80" x="260" y="35"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="300" y="130">180度</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="16" font-weight="900" x="350" y="75">→</text>
<!-- Position 4: 270 degrees -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="80" x="375" y="35"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="415" y="130">270度</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：常見圖形的Symmetry屬性對照表 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;margin:4px 0;">
<tr style="background:#1A3C6D;color:white;"><th>圖形</th><th>軸Symmetry（Symmetry軸數）</th><th>旋轉Symmetry（重數）</th></tr>
<tr><td>Square</td><td>✅ 4條</td><td>✅ 4重</td></tr>
<tr><td>Rectangle</td><td>✅ 2條</td><td>✅ 2重</td></tr>
<tr><td>等邊Triangle</td><td>✅ 3條</td><td>✅ 3重</td></tr>
<tr><td>等腰Triangle</td><td>✅ 1條</td><td>❌ 0重</td></tr>
<tr><td>Parallelogram</td><td>❌ 0條</td><td>✅ 2重</td></tr>
<tr><td>Rhombus</td><td>✅ 2條（對角線）</td><td>✅ 2重</td></tr>
<tr><td>Circle形</td><td>✅ 無限</td><td>✅ 無限重</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 關鍵Trap：Parallelogram冇軸Symmetry但有旋轉Symmetry（2重）！等腰Triangle有軸Symmetry但冇旋轉Symmetry！兩者唔係必然共存。</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：在方格紙上畫旋轉Symmetry圖形 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>給定旋轉中心：</b>標出中心點 O<br/>
      ② <b>找出對應點：</b>原來圖形的每個頂點，旋轉指定度數後的新位置<br/>
      ③ <b>90度旋轉規律：</b>(x, y) 繞中心旋轉 90度 → (-y, x)（以中心為原點）<br/>
      ④ <b>P4 簡化版：</b>用方格紙，每個頂點「橫變直、直變橫」，方向跟旋轉方向
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">在方格紙上，以 O 為旋轉中心，把圖形順時針旋轉 90 度，畫出旋轉後的圖形。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一個正六邊形有幾多重旋轉Symmetry？幾多條Symmetry軸？</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：平面圖形綜合分類 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 平面圖形分類可以按：邊數、角數、有冇直角、有冇平行邊、Symmetry屬性<br/>
      ② <b>四邊形分類重點：</b>
        - Square：4邊等長+4直角+4條Symmetry軸+4重旋轉<br/>
        - Rectangle：對邊等長+4直角+2條Symmetry軸+2重旋轉<br/>
        - Rhombus：4邊等長+對角相等+2條Symmetry軸+2重旋轉<br/>
        - Parallelogram：對邊平行等長+冇Symmetry軸+2重旋轉<br/>
        - Trapezoid：只有一對平行邊
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至四 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>寫出以下圖形的旋轉Symmetry重數：(a)Square (b)Rectangle (c)等邊Triangle (d)等腰Triangle</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>Parallelogram有冇軸Symmetry？有冇旋轉Symmetry？分別是多少？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>一個圖形只有旋轉Symmetry而沒有軸Symmetry。請舉一個例子。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>以下圖形有軸Symmetry(A)、旋轉Symmetry(R)、兩者都有(B)、定兩者都冇(N)？<br/>Square__ Rectangle__ 等腰Triangle__ Parallelogram__</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>Rhombus有幾多條Symmetry軸？旋轉Symmetry係幾多重？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
