<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><b>軸Symmetry=旋轉Symmetry</b>：以為有軸Symmetry一定有旋轉Symmetry</td><td>兩者獨立！等腰三角有軸Symmetry(1條)但冇旋轉Symmetry</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><b>Parallelogram冇任何Symmetry</b>（❌）</td><td>冇軸Symmetry但有2重旋轉Symmetry（轉180度重疊）</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><b>Rectangle旋轉Symmetry=4重</b>（❌）</td><td>Rectangle得2重旋轉Symmetry：轉180度。90度唔得！</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><b>等邊Triangle旋轉Symmetry=2重</b>（❌）</td><td>等邊Triangle3重：轉120度、240度都會重疊</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><b>旋轉Symmetry中心點位置錯</b></td><td>中心點一定係圖形正中心，旋轉時中心保持不動</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><b>正多邊形Symmetry軸數量=邊數-1</b>（❌）</td><td>正n邊形有n條Symmetry軸，n重旋轉Symmetry</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><b>Rhombus同SquareSymmetry屬性一樣</b>（❌）</td><td>Rhombus2條Symmetry軸(對角線)+2重。正方4條+4重</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「軸Symmetry靠摺疊，旋轉Symmetry靠轉圈。Square四條軸四重轉，長方兩條軸兩重轉。等腰三角有軸冇旋轉，平行四邊有轉冇軸線。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">睇圖形</div><div class="sdetail">確認圖形類型：幾邊形？邊長相等？有冇直角？</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">試摺疊（軸Symmetry）</div><div class="sdetail">想像沿不同線對摺。垂直/水平/斜向。兩邊重疊=有軸Symmetry</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">試旋轉（旋轉Symmetry）</div><div class="sdetail">想像繞中心轉。幾多度後重疊？→ 360÷度數 = 重數</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">查表覆核</div><div class="sdetail">用「圖形屬性表」核對答案。特別注意特殊情況</div></div>
</div>
